# MAGIC %md-sandbox
# MAGIC ## E. Conclusion
# MAGIC
# MAGIC - A **DAB** describes a Databricks project (code, resources, configuration) in YAML and is driven by the Databricks CLI, useful in development and CI/CD.
# MAGIC - A bundle project follows a standard structure: `databricks.yml`, `resources/`, `src/`, and `tests/`.
# MAGIC - The `databricks.yml` top-level mappings, especially **bundle**, **resources**, and **targets**, define the bundle.
# MAGIC - Three CLI commands, **validate**, **deploy**, and **run**, take a bundle from check to execution.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC ### Next Steps
# MAGIC
# MAGIC In the next demo, you will deploy a simple DAB and see these commands in action.

